{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"]},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Kubernetes on IBM Cloud: Comprehensive Learning Path","text":"<p>Welcome to the comprehensive guide for learning Kubernetes on IBM Cloud. This guide is structured as a series of sessions, each building on the previous one to develop a solid understanding of Kubernetes principles and practices using IBM Cloud Kubernetes Service.</p>"},{"location":"#learning-path-overview","title":"Learning Path Overview","text":"<ol> <li>Background and Getting Started</li> <li>Architecture and Components</li> <li>Core Resources</li> <li>Application Management</li> <li>Configuration Management</li> <li>Networking</li> <li>Storage</li> <li>Security</li> <li>Observability</li> <li>Advanced Topics and Production Readiness</li> </ol> <p>Each session includes conceptual information followed by hands-on labs to reinforce learning.</p>"},{"location":"#prerequisites","title":"Prerequisites","text":"<ul> <li>IBM Cloud account</li> <li>Basic knowledge of containerization concepts</li> <li>Familiarity with command-line interfaces</li> </ul>"},{"location":"#how-to-use-this-guide","title":"How to Use This Guide","text":"<p>The guide is designed to be followed sequentially, but you can also jump to specific topics based on your needs. Each session includes:</p> <ul> <li>Conceptual explanations</li> <li>Diagrams and illustrations</li> <li>Hands-on examples with IBM Cloud</li> <li>Lab exercises</li> </ul> <p>Let's get started with Session 1: Background and Getting Started!</p>"},{"location":"session1-background/","title":"Session 1: Background and Getting Started","text":""},{"location":"session1-background/#overview","title":"Overview","text":"<p>This session covers the following topics:</p> <ul> <li>Kubernetes History</li> <li>CNCF</li> <li>Adoption Trends</li> <li>Alternatives</li> <li>IBM Cloud Setup</li> <li>Creating First Cluster</li> <li>IBM Cloud CLI</li> <li>IBM Cloud Commands</li>